hadiths[60]{hadithnumber,text}:
"571","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Adam ke betay ka har amal us ke liye hai siwae rozay ke, beshak wo Mere liye hai aur Main hi us ka badla dunga. Aur roza dhaal hai. To jab tum mein se kisi ka rozay ka din ho to wo us din behayai ki baat na karay aur na shor machaye. Phir agar koi usay gaali de ya us se laray to wo kahay: Beshak main rozaydar aadmi hun. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Rozaydar ke munh ki boo qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se zyada pakeeza hai. Aur rozaydar ke liye do khushiyan hain jin se wo khush hota hai: Jab wo iftar karta hai to apne iftar se khush hota hai, aur jab wo apne Rab se milay ga to apne rozay se khush hoga. (Muslim: 3/158). Baab: Ramazan ke maheenay ki fazilat. (Roza gunaahon aur aag se bachanay wali dhaal hai; shor machana se murad cheekh pukaar hai.)"
"572","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan aata hai to jannat ke darwazay khol diye jatay hain, dozakh ke darwazay band kar diye jatay hain aur shaitaan jakar diye jatay hain. (Muslim: 3/122). Baab: Ramazan se aik ya do din pehle rozay se istiqbal na karo."
"573","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ramazan ka aik ya do din rozay se istiqbal na karo siwae us mard ke jo (aadat ke mutabiq) rozay rakhta ho to wo usay rakhay. (Muslim: 3/125)"
"574","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaand ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Jab tum usay dekho to rozay rakho aur jab tum usay dekho to iftar karo, phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to tees gino. (Muslim: 3/124). Baab: Maheena untees (din ka hota) hai."
"575","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qasam khai ke Aap apne baaz ghar walon ke paas aik maheena dakhil na honge, phir jab untees din guzar gaye to Aap subah ya shaam un ke paas tashreef laye. To Aap se kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Nabi! Aap ne qasam khai thi ke Aap hamaray paas aik maheena dakhil na honge. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak maheena untees din ka hota hai. (Muslim: 3/126)"
"576","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ham ummi ummat hain, na likhtay hain aur na hisab kartay hain. Maheena yun, yun aur yun hai, aur Aap ne teesri baar angutha band kiya, aur maheena yun, yun aur yun hai, yani poora tees din. (Muslim: 3/124). Baab: Beshak Allah ne usay (chaand ko) dekhay janay ke liye bara kiya."
"577","[AI-translation] Abul Bakhtari se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham umrah ke liye niklay, phir jab ham Batn-e-Nakhla mein utray to ham ne chaand dekh nay ki koshish ki. To baaz logon ne kaha: Wo teen raaton ka hai, aur baaz ne kaha: Wo do raaton ka hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ham Ibn Abbas se milay to ham ne kaha: Beshak ham ne chaand dekha, to baaz ne kaha wo teen raaton ka hai aur baaz ne kaha wo do raaton ka hai. To unhon ne kaha: Tum ne usay kis raat dekha? Unhon ne kaha: To ham ne kaha: Falan falan raat. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne usay dekhay janay ke liye (muddat) bara kar diya, to wo usi raat ka hai jis mein tum ne usay dekha. (Muslim: 3/127). Baab: Har shehar walon ke liye un ka apna dekhna hai. (Unhon ne usay bara dekh kar aisa kaha; bara hona motabar nahi.)"
"578","[AI-translation] Kuraib se riwayat hai ke Umm Fadl bint Haris ne usay Shaam mein Muawiya ke paas bheja. Unhon ne kaha: To main Shaam aaya aur un ka kaam poora kiya, aur mujh par Ramazan ka chaand nikla jabke main Shaam mein tha, to main ne Juma ki raat chaand dekha, phir main (maheenay ke aakhir mein Madina) aaya. To Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne mujh se poocha aur chaand ka zikr kiya: Tum ne usay kab dekha? Main ne kaha: Juma ki raat. Unhon ne poocha: Kya tum ne khud dekha? Main ne kaha: Haan, aur logon ne bhi dekha aur rozay rakhay, aur Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) ne aur logon ne bhi rozay rakhay. To Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Lekin ham ne usay Hafta ki raat dekha, to ham tees rozay pooray karein ge ya chaand dekhein ge. To main ne kaha: Kya Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) ka dekhna aur un ka rozay rakhna tumhein kaafi nahi? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, hamein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne isi ka hukm diya hai. (Muslim). (Asal mein nazala tha, Muslim se tasheeh ki gayi.)"
"579","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Eid ke do maheenay kam nahi hotay: Ramazan aur Zilhajja. (Muslim: 3/127). Baab: Rozay mein sehri ke baaray mein."
"580","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sehri karo, beshak sehri mein barkat hai. (Muslim: 3/130). Baab: Sehri mein takheer."
"581","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Sabit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath sehri ki phir ham namaz ke liye khaday hue. Main ne kaha: Un donon ke darmiyan kitna fasla tha? Unhon ne kaha: Pachaas aayatein (padhnay ka waqfa). (Muslim: 3/131). Baab: Us fajr ki sifat jo rozaydar par khana haraam karti hai."
"582","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhein tumhari sehri se Bilal ki azaan dhoka na de aur na ufaq ki lambi safedi yun, yahan tak ke wo yun phail jaye. Aur Hammad ne apne donon haathon se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yani aar paar (phaili hui). (Muslim: 3/130). Baab: Allah Taala ke qaul ke baaray mein: Yahan tak ke tumharay liye safed dhaaga kalay dhaagay se wazeh ho jaye."
"583","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye aayat naazil hui: Aur khao aur piyo yahan tak ke tumharay liye safed dhaaga kalay dhaagay se wazeh ho jaye. Unhon ne kaha: To jab aadmi rozay ka irada karta to un mein se koi apni taang mein kala dhaaga aur safed dhaaga bandh leta, phir wo khata peeta rehta yahan tak ke usay un donon ka dekhna wazeh ho jata. To Allah ne us ke baad min-al-fajr naazil farmaya, to unhon ne jaan liya ke is se murad raat aur din hain. (Muslim: 3/128)"
"584","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke do muazzin thay: Bilal aur nabina Ibn Umm Maktoom. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Bilal raat mein azaan de detay hain, to khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktoom azaan dein. Unhon ne kaha: Aur un donon ke darmiyan sirf itna fasla hota ke ye utartay aur ye chadhtay. (Muslim: 3/129). Baab: Us rozaydar ka rozah jisay fajr janabat mein paa le."
"585","[AI-translation] Aisha aur Umm Salama, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki azwaaj, se riwayat hai ke un donon ne kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ramazan mein jima ki wajah se, ehtelam ke baghair, janabat mein subah kartay phir rozah rakhtay. (Muslim: 3/138)"
"586","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik mard Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas fatwa poochnay aaya jabke wo darwazay ke peechay se sun rahi thin. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe namaz paa leti hai jabke main janbi hun, to kya main rozah rakhun? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe bhi namaz paa leti hai jabke main janbi hota hun to main rozah rakhta hun. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ham jaisay nahi, Allah ne Aap ke aglay pichlay gunah bakhsh diye hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Beshak mujhe ummeed hai ke main tum mein Allah se sab se zyada darnay wala hun aur usay sab se zyada jannay wala hun jis se main bachta hun. (Muslim: 3/138). Baab: Rozaydar bhool kar khaye ya piye ke baaray mein."
"587","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhool jaye jabke wo rozaydar ho, phir kha le ya pi le, to wo apna rozah poora karay, beshak usay Allah ne khilaya aur pilaya hai. (Muslim: 3/160). Baab: Rozaydar ko khanay ki dawat di jaye to wo kahay ke main rozaydar hun ke baaray mein."
"588","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko khanay ki dawat di jaye jabke wo rozaydar ho to wo kahay: Beshak main rozaydar hun. (Muslim: 3/157). Baab: Us ka kaffara jo Ramazan mein apni biwi se sohbat karay."
"589","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik mard Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main halak ho gaya, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne farmaya: Tumhein kis ne halak kiya? Us ne kaha: Main Ramazan mein apni biwi se sohbat kar baitha. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum patay ho jo tum gardan azaad karo? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum taqat rakhtay ho ke do maheena lagatar rozay rakho? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum patay ho jo tum saath miskeenon ko khilao? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To wo baith gaya yahan tak ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas khajoor ka tokra laya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye le lo aur sadqa kar do. Us ne kaha: Kya (Madina ki) do siyah pathreeli zameenon ke darmiyan mujh se zyada faqeer par? Beshak is bast mein mere ghar walon se zyada mohtaj koi ghar nahi. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hansay yahan tak ke Aap ki daahrein zaahir ho gayeen, phir Aap ne farmaya: Ye le jao aur apne ghar walon ko khilao. (Muslim). (Araq se murad tokra hai; harratayn se murad Madina ki do siyah pathreeli zameenein hain.)"
"590","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik mard Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main jal gaya. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kyun? Us ne kaha: Main ne Ramazan mein din ko apni biwi se sohbat ki. Aap ne farmaya: Sadqa karo, sadqa karo. Us ne kaha: Mere paas kuch nahi. To Aap ne usay baith nay ka hukm diya. Phir Aap ke paas khanay se bharay do tokray aaye to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay hukm diya ke wo usay sadqa kar de. (Muslim: 3/140). Baab: Rozaydar ke bosay ke baaray mein."
"591","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) rozaydar hotay hue bosa detay aur rozaydar hotay hue gale lagatay, lekin Aap apni khwahish par tum mein se sab se zyada qabu rakhnay walay thay. (Muslim: 3/135). Baab: Jab raat aa jaye aur sooraj ghuroob ho jaye to rozaydar iftar karay. (Mubashirat se murad kapray ke peechay se jism milana hai; irb se murad uzw hai.)"
"592","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abu Aufa (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Ramazan ke maheenay mein safar mein thay, phir jab sooraj ghuroob ho gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ae falan! Utro aur hamaray liye sattu ghol. Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak Aap par din hai. Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur hamaray liye ghol. Unhon ne kaha: To wo utra aur us ne ghola aur Aap ke paas laya to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne piya, phir Aap ne apne haath se (ishara kar ke) farmaya: Jab sooraj yahan se ghuroob ho jaye aur raat yahan se aa jaye to rozaydar ne iftar kar liya. (Muslim: 3/132). Baab: Iftar mein jaldi karnay ke baaray mein. (Jadh se murad sattu ko pani mein mila kar hilana hai; haath se murad mashriq o maghrib ki taraf ishara hai.)"
"593","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Log hamesha khair par rahein ge jab tak wo iftar mein jaldi karein ge. (Muslim: 3/131)"
"594","[AI-translation] Abu Atiya se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Masrooq Aisha ke paas dakhil hue to Masrooq ne un se kaha: Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se do mard, donon khair mein koi kami nahi kartay, un mein se aik Maghrib aur iftar mein jaldi karta hai aur doosra Maghrib aur iftar mein dair karta hai. To unhon ne kaha: Maghrib aur iftar mein jaldi kaun karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Abdullah. To unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) isi tarah kartay thay. (Muslim: 3/131-132). Baab: Rozay mein wisal se mumaniat."
"595","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wisal (baghair iftar musalsal rozay rakhnay) se mana farmaya. To Musalmanon mein se aik mard ne kaha: Beshak Aap, Ae Allah ke Rasool, wisal kartay hain. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kaun meri tarah hai? Beshak main raat guzarta hun ke mera Rab mujhe khilata aur pilata hai. Phir jab unhon ne wisal se ruknay se inkar kiya to Aap ne un ke saath aik din phir aik din wisal kiya, phir unhon ne chaand dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaand muakkhar hota to main tumhein aur zyada (wisal karata), unhein sazaa denay walay ki tarah jab unhon ne ruknay se inkar kiya. (Muslim: 3/133). Baab: Safar mein rozah aur iftar."
"596","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ramazan mein safar kiya to Aap ne rozah rakha yahan tak ke Usfan pahunchay, phir Aap ne aik bartan mangwaya jis mein sharbat tha to Aap ne din ko usay piya taake log dekhein, phir Aap ne iftar kiya yahan tak ke Makka dakhil hue. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne rozah rakha aur iftar kiya, to jo chahay rozah rakhay aur jo chahay iftar karay. (Muslim: 3/141). (Usfan Makka se chatees meel par aik qasba hai.)"
"597","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fatah (Makka) ke saal Ramazan mein Makka ki taraf niklay to Aap ne rozah rakha yahan tak ke Kura-ul-Ghameem pahunchay, to logon ne bhi rozah rakha, phir Aap ne pani ka pyala mangwaya aur usay buland kiya yahan tak ke logon ne usay dekha, phir Aap ne piya. To Aap se us ke baad kaha gaya: Beshak baaz logon ne rozah rakha hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Wohi nafarman hain, wohi nafarman hain. (Muslim: 3/141-142). Baab: Safar mein rozah rakhna neki nahi. (Kura-ul-Ghameem Usfan ke saamnay aik waadi hai; Muslim ki aik riwayat mein izafa hai ke Aap se kaha gaya ke logon par rozah mashaqqat ban gaya hai; ye un par mahmool hai jin par rozah mashaqqat ban gaya ho.)"
"598","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) safar mein thay to Aap ne aik mard ko dekha jis par log jama thay aur us par saya kiya gaya tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Usay kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rozaydar mard hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Safar mein rozah rakhna neki nahi hai. (Muslim: 3/142). (Saya se murad dhoop se bachanay ke liye parda hai.)"
"599","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath sola Ramazan guzar nay ke baad ghazwa kiya, to ham mein se baaz ne rozah rakha aur baaz ne iftar kiya, to na rozaydar ne ghair rozaydar par aib lagaya aur na ghair rozaydar ne rozaydar par. (Muslim: 3/142). Baab: Safar mein iftar karnay walay ka ajar jab wo kaam karay."
"600","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath safar mein thay, to ham mein se rozaydar bhi thay aur ghair rozaydar bhi. Unhon ne kaha: To ham sakht garmi ke din aik manzil mein utray, ham mein sab se zyada saya walay chadar walay thay aur ham mein se baaz dhoop se apne haath se bachtay thay. Unhon ne kaha: To rozaydar gir paray aur ghair rozaydaron ne khaday ho kar khaimay lagaye aur sawariyon ko pani pilaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aaj ghair rozaydar ajar le gaye. (Muslim: 3/144). Baab: Dushman se muqablay ki taqat ke liye iftar. (Abniya se murad khaimay hain; rikab se murad sawari ke oont hain.)"
"601","[AI-translation] Qaza se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Sa'id Khudri ke paas aaya jabke un par log toot paray thay, phir jab log un se muntashir ho gaye to main ne kaha: Beshak main tum se wo nahi poochta jo ye log tum se poochtay hain. Main ne un se safar mein rozay ke baaray mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Makka tak safar kiya jabke ham rozaydar thay. Unhon ne kaha: To ham aik manzil mein utray to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum apne dushman se qareeb ho gaye ho aur iftar tumharay liye zyada taqat wala hai, to ye rukhsat thi. To ham mein se baaz ne rozah rakha aur baaz ne iftar kiya. Phir ham doosri manzil mein utray to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum subah apne dushman se muqabla karo ge aur iftar tumharay liye zyada taqat wala hai, to iftar karo, aur ye azeemat thi. To ham ne iftar kiya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne hamein dekha ke ham us ke baad safar mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath rozah rakhtay thay. (Muslim: 3/144). Baab: Safar mein rozah aur iftar mein ikhtiyar."
"602","[AI-translation] Hamza bin Amr Aslami (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main safar mein rozah rakhnay ki taqat patata hun, to kya mujh par haraj hai? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ye Allah ki taraf se rukhsat hai, to jo usay le us ke liye behtar hai, aur jo rozah rakhna pasand karay to us par koi haraj nahi. (Muslim: 3/145). (Is hadees mein iftar ko rozay par fazilat denay ki daleel nahi jaisa baaz ne daawa kiya; ye ikhtiyar par dalalat karti hai.)"
"603","[AI-translation] Abud Darda (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah ke saath Ramazan ke maheenay mein sakht garmi mein niklay yahan tak ke ham mein se koi garmi ki shiddat ki wajah se apna haath apne sar par rakhta tha, aur ham mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Abdullah bin Rawaha ke siwa koi rozaydar na tha. (Muslim: 3/145). Baab: Shaban mein Ramazan ki qaza."
"604","[AI-translation] Abu Salama se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ko kehtay hue suna: Mujh par Ramazan ka rozah hota to main us ki qaza Shaban ke siwa (kisi maheenay) mein na kar sakti thi, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki mashghooliyat ki wajah se. (Muslim: 3/154). Baab: Maiyyat ki taraf se rozon ki qaza. (Murad ye hai ke wo Nabi ki khidmat mein mashghooliyat ki wajah se qaza muakkhar kartin.)"
"605","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo mar jaye jabke us par rozay hon to us ka wali us ki taraf se rozay rakhay. (Muslim: 3/155)"
"606","[AI-translation] Buraida (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas baitha hua tha ke Aap ke paas aik aurat aayi aur kaha: Beshak main ne apni maan par aik londi sadqa ki thi aur wo faut ho gayi. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara ajar wajib ho gaya aur miras ne usay tumhein wapas kar diya. Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak us par aik maheenay ke rozay thay, to kya main us ki taraf se rozay rakhun? Aap ne farmaya: Us ki taraf se rozay rakho. Us ne kaha: Beshak us ne kabhi hajj nahi kiya, to kya main us ki taraf se hajj karun? Aap ne farmaya: Us ki taraf se hajj karo. (Muslim: 3/156). Baab: Allah Taala ke qaul ke baaray mein: Aur jo us ki taqat rakhtay hain un par fidya hai."
"607","[AI-translation] Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye aayat naazil hui: Aur jo us ki taqat rakhtay hain un par fidya hai, miskeen ka khana. To jo iftar karna aur fidya dena chahta wo (aisa) karta, yahan tak ke us ke baad wali aayat naazil hui to us ne usay mansookh kar diya. (Muslim: 3/154). Baab: Maheenon mein rozah aur iftar. (Ibarat mein hazf hai, taqdeer hai ke jo aisa karna chahta wo karta.)"
"608","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Shaqeeq se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha se kaha: Kya Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) poora maheena rozah rakhtay thay? Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe maloom nahi ke Aap ne Ramazan ke siwa poora maheena rozah rakha ho aur na usay poora iftar kiya yahan tak ke us mein se rozah rakhtay, yahan tak ke Aap apne rastay par chalay gaye (wafaat paa gaye). (Muslim: 3/160)"
"609","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi banda Allah ke rastay mein aik din rozah nahi rakhta magar Allah us din ke zariye us ka chehra aag se sattar saal door kar deta hai. (Muslim: 3/159). Baab: Muharram ke rozay ki fazilat."
"610","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ramazan ke baad sab se afzal rozah Allah ka maheena Muharram hai, aur farz ke baad sab se afzal namaz raat ki namaz hai. (Muslim: 3/169). Baab: Ashura ke din ka rozah."
"611","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Quraish zamanay jahiliyat mein Ashura ka rozah rakhtay thay, phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke rozay ka hukm diya yahan tak ke Ramazan farz ho gaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo chahay wo usay rakhay aur jo chahay wo usay chhor de. (Muslim: 3/147). Baab: Ashura mein kis din rozah rakhay."
"612","[AI-translation] Hakam bin Araj se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas ke paas pahuncha jabke wo Zamzam mein apni chadar ka takiya lagaye hue thay. To main ne un se kaha: Mujhe Ashura ke rozay ke baaray mein bataiye. To unhon ne kaha: Jab tum Muharram ka chaand dekho to gino aur nawen din subah rozaydar ho jao. Main ne kaha: Kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) isi tarah usay rakhtay thay? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. (Muslim: 3/151). Baab: Ashura ke din ke rozay ki fazilat. (Zaahir se murad nawen ka rozah ma'a daswen hai; Nabi ne aindah saal nawen ke rozay ka irada farmaya tha magar us se pehle wafaat paa gaye.)"
"613","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina tashreef laye to Aap ne Yahud ko Ashura ke din rozaydar paya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se poocha: Tum is din rozah kyun rakhtay ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ye bara din hai jis mein Allah ne Musa (alaihissalam) ko aur Bani Israil ko Firaun se nijaat di aur Firaun aur us ki qaum ko gharaq kiya. To Musa (alaihissalam) ne shukr mein is din rozah rakha aur ham bhi rozah rakhtay hain. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ham tum se Musa (alaihissalam) se zyada qareeb aur zyada haq rakhtay hain. Phir Aap ne us din rozah rakha aur sahaba ko rozah rakhnay ka hukm diya. (Muslim). (Muhashshi ki tehqeeq: Ashura daswen hai, nawan nahi, aur Aap aindah saal nawen ke rozay se pehle wafaat paa gaye; Baihaqi ke mutabiq 612 mein nawen se murad daswen ke saath hai.)"
"614","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abu Yazid se, Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se sama ke sath riwayat hai, un se Ashura ke din ke rozay ke baaray mein poocha gaya to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe maloom nahi ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dinon mein se kisi din ka rozah us ki fazilat talab kartay hue rakha ho siwae is din ke, aur na maheenon mein se siwae is maheenay ke, yani Ramazan. (Muslim: 3/150). Baab: Jo Ashura ke din kha le to wo baaqi din (khanay se) ruk jaye."
"615","[AI-translation] Rubayyi bint Muawwiz bin Afra se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ashura ki subah Madina ke gird Ansaar ki bastiyon ko (paigham) bheja: Jo subah rozaydar utha ho wo apna rozah poora karay, aur jo subah ghair rozaydar utha ho wo baaqi din (khanay se) ruk jaye. To ham us ke baad usay rakhtay thay aur apne chotay bachon ko us ka rozah rakhwatay thay, inshaAllah, aur masjid ko jatay aur un ke liye oon se khilona banatay, phir jab un mein se koi khanay par rota to ham usay iftar ke waqt wo (khilona behlanay ko) detay. (Muslim: 3/152). Baab: Shaban ka rozah. (Ihn se murad gudiyon ke khilona hain; ihn oon hai; ibarat mein hazf hai, taqdeer hai yahan tak ke iftar ka waqt ho.)"
"616","[AI-translation] Abu Salama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aisha se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke rozon ke baaray mein poocha. To unhon ne kaha: Aap rozah rakhtay yahan tak ke ham kehtay ke Aap ne rozah rakh liya, aur iftar kartay yahan tak ke ham kehtay ke Aap ne iftar kar liya. Aur main ne Aap ko kisi maheenay mein Shaban se zyada rozah rakhtay nahi dekha, Aap poora Shaban rozah rakhtay, Aap Shaban ke thori (dinon) ke siwa rozah rakhtay. (Muslim: 3/161). Baab: Shaban ke aakhri (dinon) ke rozay ke baaray mein."
"617","[AI-translation] Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se ya kisi aur se farmaya: Kya tum ne Shaban ke darmiyan rozah rakha? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir jab tum iftar kar lo to do din rozah rakho. (Muslim: 3/168). Baab: Ramazan ke saath Shawwal ke chhe rozay milana. (Surar se murad darmiyan hai; Muslim ki aik riwayat mein surra hai, waadi ka darmiyan us ka behtareen hissa hota hai.)"
"618","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan ke rozay rakhay phir us ke saath Shawwal ke chhe (rozay) milaye to wo zamanay bhar ke rozon ki tarah hai. (Muslim: 3/169)"
"619","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ashray mein kabhi rozaydar nahi dekha. (Muslim: 3/176). Baab: Arafa ke din ka rozah."
"620","[AI-translation] Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik mard Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Aap kaisay rozah rakhtay hain? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke qaul se ghussa hue. Phir jab Umar ne Aap ka ghussa dekha to kaha: Ham Allah ke Rab honay par, Islam ke deen honay par aur Muhammad ke Nabi honay par raazi hain. Ham Allah ke ghussay aur Us ke Rasool ke ghussay se Allah ki panah maangtay hain. To Umar ye kalam dohratay rahay yahan tak ke Aap ka ghussa thanda ho gaya. To Umar ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Us ka kya haal hai jo poora saal rozah rakhta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Us ne rozah rakha na iftar kiya. Ya Aap ne farmaya: Us ne rozah nahi rakha aur na iftar kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Us ka kya haal hai jo do din rozah rakhta hai aur aik din iftar karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aur is ki kaun taqat rakhta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Us ka kya haal hai jo aik din rozah rakhta hai aur aik din iftar karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Wo Dawood (alaihissalam) ka rozah hai. Unhon ne kaha: Us ka kya haal hai jo aik din rozah rakhta hai aur do din iftar karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kaash mujhe is ki taqat di jati. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Har maheenay mein teen (rozay) aur Ramazan se Ramazan tak, ye poora saal rozah rakhna hai. Arafa ke din ke rozay ke baaray mein main Allah se ummeed rakhta hun ke wo us se pehlay saal aur us ke baad walay saal ka kaffara banay ga, aur Ashura ke din ke rozay ke baaray mein main Allah se ummeed rakhta hun ke wo us se pehlay saal ka kaffara banay ga. (Muslim: 3/167). Baab: Haaji ke liye Arafa ke din rozah chhorna. (Muslim mein zaalik hai.)"
"621","[AI-translation] Umm Fadl bint Haris se riwayat hai ke Arafa ke din un ke paas logon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke rozay mein ikhtilaf kiya. To baaz ne kaha: Aap rozaydar hain, aur baaz ne kaha: Aap rozaydar nahi hain. To unhon ne Aap ki taraf doodh ka pyala bheja jabke Aap Arafa mein apne oont par kharay thay, to Aap ne usay piya. (Muslim: 3/146). Baab: Eid-ul-Azha aur Eid-ul-Fitr ke din rozah rakhnay se mumaniat."
"622","[AI-translation] Abu Ubaid, Ibn Azhar ke azaad kardah, se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Umar bin Khattab ke saath Eid mein haazir hua. To wo aaye aur namaz padhi phir wapas hue aur logon ko khutba diya. To unhon ne kaha: Beshak ye do din hain jin mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne rozah rakhnay se mana farmaya hai: Tumharay rozon se iftar ka din, aur doosra wo din jis mein tum apni qurbaniyon mein se khatay ho. (Muslim: 3/152)"
"623","[AI-translation] Nubaisha Huzali se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tashreeq ke din khanay peenay ke din hain. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur Allah ke zikr ke. (Muslim: 3/153). Baab: Peer ke din ka rozah."
"624","[AI-translation] Abu Qatada se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Peer ke rozay ke baaray mein poocha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Is mein main paida hua aur is mein mujh par (wahi) naazil hui. (Muslim: 3/168). Baab: Juma ka akela rozah rakhnay ki karahat."
"625","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi Juma ke din rozah na rakhay siwae is ke ke us se pehle rozah rakhay ya us ke baad rozah rakhay. (Muslim: 3/154). (Muslim mein la yasum hai.)"
"626","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Juma ki raat ko raaton mein se qiyam ke liye khaas na karo aur na Juma ke din ko dinon mein se rozay ke liye khaas karo siwae is ke ke wo us rozay mein ho jo tum mein se koi rakhta ho. (Muslim: 3/154). Baab: Har maheenay mein teen din ka rozah."
"627","[AI-translation] Muaza Adawiya se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Aisha se poocha: Kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) har maheenay mein teen din rozah rakhtay thay? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. To main ne un se kaha: Maheenay ke kin dinon mein rozah rakhtay thay? Unhon ne kaha: Wo parwa na kartay thay ke maheenay ke kin dinon mein rozah rakhtay hain. (Muslim: 3/166). Baab: Lagatar rozah rakhnay ki karahat. (Muslim mein yubaali hai.)"
"628","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar pahunchi ke main lagatar rozah rakhta hun aur raat namaz padhta hun. To ya Aap ne meri taraf (paigham) bheja ya main Aap se mila. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya mujhe khabar nahi di gayi ke tum rozah rakhtay ho aur iftar nahi kartay aur raat namaz padhtay ho? Aisa na karo, beshak tumhari aankhon ka tum par haq hai, tumhari zaat ka tum par haq hai aur tumhari biwi ka tum par haq hai. To rozah rakho aur iftar bhi karo, aur (nawafil) padho aur so bhi. Aur har das din mein aik din rozah rakho, beshak tumhein baaqi nau dinon ka bhi ajar milay ga. Main ne kaha: Main apne mein is se zyada ki taqat patata hun. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Phir Dawood (alaihissalam) ka rozah rakho. Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi! Un ka rozah kya tha? Aap ne farmaya: Wo aik din rozah rakhtay thay aur aglay din iftar kartay thay, aur jab dushman ka samna kartay to jihad se kabhi na bhagtay thay. Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi! Dushman se na bhagnay ki ye taqat mujhe kaisay hasil ho? Ata (hadees ke rawi) ne kaha: Phir mujhe maloom nahi ke musalsal rozay ka zikr kaisay aaya, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne is ke baaray mein farmaya: Jo hamesha rozah rakhta us ne rozah nahi rakha. Jo hamesha rozah rakhta us ne rozah nahi rakha. (Muslim). (Muslim mein anni asoom asrud hai.)"
"629","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke nazdeek sab se pasandeeda rozah Dawood ka rozah hai, aur Allah ke nazdeek sab se pasandeeda namaz Dawood (alaihissalam) ki namaz hai. Wo aadhi raat sotay, us ka teesra hissa qiyam kartay aur us ka chhata hissa sotay, aur wo aik din rozah rakhtay aur aik din iftar kartay. (Muslim: 3/165). Baab: Jo subah nafl rozaydar ho phir iftar kar le."
"630","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik din mere paas tashreef laye aur farmaya: Kya tumharay paas kuch hai? To ham ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir beshak main rozaydar hun. Phir Aap hamaray paas doosray din tashreef laye to ham ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Hamein hais hadiya kiya gaya hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe wo dikhao, beshak main subah rozaydar utha tha. Phir Aap ne khaya. (Muslim: 3/160). (Hais khajoor, ghee aur paneer ka halwa hai.)"
